  "focus": "Class 8 consolidates middle-school learning while opening the door to higher concepts: linear equations, rational numbers, force and pressure, and modern Indian history. It is the ideal year to build exam temperament — timed worksheets, neat presentation and regular revision — before the syllabus pressure of Classes 9 and 10.",
