    {
      "question": "What should Class 8 students focus on in Mathematics?",
      "answer": "Algebraic fluency: rational numbers, linear equations and identities. These tools reappear in every later class, so speed and accuracy here pay compound interest."
    },
    {
      "question": "How much daily study does Class 8 need?",
      "answer": "Two focused hours beyond school — one for the day's chapters, one for Mathematics practice and revision — beats weekend cramming."
